lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Completely custom mountain Ranges and landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Toggleable flashlight for dark areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One insane twist that you don't want to miss out on!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.poster.avif?t=1771103682\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.webm?t=1771103682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.mp4?t=1771103682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["CosmicArcade"],"dlc":[4110010],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/dce7b9426c6a23cc3dc87a33bce86d8b1421cc33/header.jpg?t=1771103682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943880/215697918/2346b4fbc1996b687b22d1d03bac48c9552d0f1f/1759248857/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759600991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943880/215697918/2346b4fbc1996b687b22d1d03bac48c9552d0f1f/1759248857/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759600991","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943880/215697918/2346b4fbc1996b687b22d1d03bac48c9552d0f1f/1759248857/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759600991","id":257209411,"name":"Labs Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209411/55a04bc7ce9e9ec9c04446b13759ea4dfcf5c022/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759600991"},{"dash_av1":"https://vi